SUMMARY:Brookwood's Annual Fall Fest - Sept. 10-12
DTSTAMP:20260802T054429Z
DTSTART:20260910T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Embrace the Beauty of Fall at Brookwood!\n\nThursday–Saturday |
	 September 10-12 | 9:00am–4:30pm\nBrookwood® Gift & Garden Center and Café
	 | 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX 77423 \nCelebrate the beauty of fall and
	 the power of purpose at Brookwood® Fall Fest! Shop an incredible variety 
	of artisan vendor booths featuring handcrafted gifts\, seasonal décor\, an
	d one-of-a-kind treasures—perfect for early holiday prep or just treating 
	yourself! \nSupport local makers and adults with disabilities at The Brook
	wood Community™ all in one festive fall day! Stroll through the Brookwood 
	Gift & Garden Center stocked with Citizen-made ceramics\, garden goods\, h
	ome accents\, and stunning fall florals. \n🎁 Shop with a Purpose. Dine wit
	h a Purpose. Celebrate Fall with a Purpose with over 40 Local Vendors!\n🍽️ 
	Savor a delicious lunch at The Brookwood Café from 11:00am–2:30pm\n☕ Stop 
	by our Coffee Cart for delicious drinks\, tasty snacks\, and convenient bo
	x lunches\n🌿 Sip and shop at the Wine Bar in the Garden \nMake it a day to
	 remember—and a weekend that gives back!\n\nAre you a Vendor? Contact the 
	Gift Shop at 281-375-2149 to get details!\n  \nThank you for supporting th
	e beloved adults with disABILITIES who live and work at Brookwood!\n \nVis
	it our Events Calendar for the full schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming event
	s.   \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities\n\
	nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwoods-annual-fall-fest-sept-10-
	12/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwoods-annual-fall-fest-sept-1
	0-12/
LOCATION:Brookwood Gift & Garden Center & Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\
	, TX\, 77423\, United States
