SUMMARY:The Brookwood Way Conference Sept 22-24
DTSTAMP:20260802T054429Z
DTSTART:20260921T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience The Brookwood Way – A Conference That Changes Everyt
	hing\nSeptember 21–25\, 2026 from 8:30am–4:00pm at The Brookwood Community
	\, Brookshire\, Texas\n\nThis three-day conference provides an engaging\, 
	behind-the-scenes experience designed to fully immerse participants in our
	 culture\, methodology\, and practices\, which we call The Brookwood Way. 
	\nDiscover a proven\, purpose-driven model that empowers adults with disab
	ilities to live with dignity\, purpose\, and meaningful work. The Brookwoo
	d Way Conference is an immersive\, behind-the-scenes experience at The Bro
	okwood Community in Brookshire\, Texas\, created for leaders\, families\, 
	nonprofits\, ministries\, and organizations seeking to build or strengthen
	 thriving communities for adults with disabilities. \nExperience The Brook
	wood Way firsthand as you tour our campus\, connect with our leadership te
	am\, and see a living model in action. You’ll leave inspired and equipped 
	with practical ideas\, proven strategies\, and adaptable tools to help cre
	ate communities where adults with disabilities can flourish. \nWho should 
	attend? \n\nIndividuals and organizations that are serving or desire to se
	rve adults with disabilities\nProfessionals who desire to create more oppo
	rtunities for people with disabilities or other underserved populations\nT
	eachers\, administrators\, parents\, church groups\, healthcare profession
	als\, non-profits or anyone seeking inspiration to make a difference\n\n$4
	95 Early Bird Pricing (Conference Fee after Sept. 1—$550 per person) \nREG
	ISTER TODAY\n\nWhat If Three Days Isn’t Enough?\nThere are two PRE-Confere
	nce sessions and two POST-Conference sessions available! \nChoose a PRE-Co
	nference Experience for Monday\, Sept. 21:\n\nSatellite Immersion Opportun
	ity – Get Inspired. See it in action! REGISTER HEREA unique pre-conference
	 site visit to one of our Satellite Work Programs designed to provide a re
	al-world glimpse into what a Brookwood-inspired start-up can look like. Bo
	th locations are generously donated spaces\, reflecting our commitment to 
	fiscal stewardship\, and each visit includes a guided tour\, time observin
	g our Citizens at work\, and lunch with a Brookwood leader who will share 
	insights on startup strategy and building a mission-led program. OR\nIntro
	duction to Handbells Workshop – Add music to your conference! REGISTER HER
	E\nLearn the basics of teaching handbells using a Brookwood-developed meth
	od\, including proper technique for ringing handbells and handchimes and a
	n introduction to reading adaptive notation. Helps you discover if this is
	 an experience you would like to offer to those you serve.\n\nChoose a POS
	T-Conference Experience for Friday\, Sept. 25:\n\nFundraising Essentials C
	ourse – Go Behind the Scenes with Brookwood’s Development Team! REGISTER H
	ERELearn proven fundraising strategies from Brookwood’s Development Team\,
	 covering donor cultivation\, foundation relationships\, peer-to-peer fund
	raising\, events\, volunteer engagement\, and donor management systems. OR
	\nFundamentals of Citizen Life – Go Beyond the Tour and See how We Create 
	Community REGISTER HERE\nAn in-depth look at the divisions that make up Ci
	tizen Life at Brookwood: Residential\, Work Program\, Spiritual Life\, Adm
	issions\, Medical\, and Activities. Led by our department leaders\, with t
	ime for Q&A.\n\n  \nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disAB
	ILITIES who live and work at Brookwood! \nChanging the way the world think
	s about adults with disabilities \nVisit our Events Calendar for the full 
	schedule of Brookwood’s upcoming events.  \n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.o
	rg/event/the-brookwood-way-conference-sept-22-24/\n\nFrom Nutcracker Marke
	t
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/the-brookwood-way-conference-sept-
	22-24/
LOCATION:The Brookwood Community Main Campus\, 1752 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, 
	TX\, 77423\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT104H
END:VEVENT
