DESCRIPTION:Brookwood Horticulture Workshop: Succulent Pumpkin Centerpiece\
	nA Fall Favorite You Won’t Want to Miss!\n\n\nAutumn is calling—and so are
	 the pumpkins! Join us for one of Brookwood’s most beloved seasonal tradit
	ions: the Succulent Pumpkin Centerpiece Workshop\, led by Horticulture GM 
	Robert Grove. In this hands-on experience\, you’ll blend the rich textures
	 of fall with the fresh beauty of succulents to craft a one-of-a-kind cent
	erpiece that’s perfect for your table—or to gift to someone special! \n🍂 W
	hat’s Included: \n\nCreate & Take: Design your very own succulent pumpkin 
	masterpiece to take home and enjoy all season long.\nExpert Guidance: Lear
	n arrangement tips and care techniques from Brookwood’s own horticulture p
	ro\, Robert Grove.\nFlexible Scheduling: Choose from 10 sessions over two 
	days—making it easy to fit into your busy fall calendar.\n\nCelebrate the 
	beauty of the season with friends\, creativity\, and purpose—surrounded by
	 the plants grown and cared for by the incredible Citizens of Brookwood®. 
	\n\n📍 Hosted at Brookwood Gift & Garden Center🌟 Let your fall décor tell a
	 story of creativity\, community\, and heart. \n\n\nDates: Friday & Saturd
	ay\, October 9 & 10\, 2024 \nTime: Choose from Five Sessions Each Day: \n\
	n\n9-10 AM\n10:15-11:15 AM\n11:30 AM-12:30 PM\n1-2 PM\n2:30-3:30 PM\n\nLoc
	ation: Horticulture Building\, Behind the Garden Center \n\nRegistration: 
	$45 (plus tax) covers all the materials needed to make your own centerpiec
	e. Space is limited\, so reserve your spot today! \nGrab your tickets toda
	y!\n\n\n  \nDining Options: \n\n\nLunch at The Brookwood Café: Available F
	riday and Saturday from 11 AM – 2 PM.\nLunch reservations are required and
	 can be made here: https://bit.ly/BWOpenTable\nPlease note: Food is not in
	cluded with the event ticket.\n\n  \nJoin us for an inspiring afternoon of
	 horticultural know-how\, flavorful food\, and a purposeful take-home gift
	! Reserve your spot today! \nWhen you’re in the checkout cart\, please cli
	ck the “ORDER NOTE” option to let us know if you’d like to sit with specif
	ic guests. Be sure to include their names so we can arrange seating accord
	ingly. Please note that our luncheon tables seat up to 8 guests. \n\n\n  \
	nThank you for supporting the beloved adults with disABILITIES who live an
	d work at Brookwood! \nChanging the way the world thinks about adults with
